    <array name="weight_bfs_help_tips">
        <item>Turn off Bluetooth on the other device first, then pair with your phone.</item>
        <item>Step on the scale to check if it shows your weight. If it displays a battery icon, replace the batteries.</item>
        <item>If there\'s no response when you step on the scale, check if the batteries are installed properly.</item>
        <item>If the device is charged, but the phone can\'t see it, try restarting phone\'s Bluetooth.</item>
        <item>If restarting Bluetooth doesn\'t solve the problem, try rebooting the phone.</item>
    </array>
    <array name="weight_bfs_help_title">
        <item>Is this scale paired with another device?</item>
        <item>Check the scale\'s battery</item>
